    {
      "id": "9761f384087f34f304ebd6e64a6371929b784dadc7c955d5ff5d6893acdb4c59",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "a063b750ee8a7d374116670d74d4c4ea0b19732dbfaafac34c9c6932fe609340",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "55920d2447f31f06409393599b23eb635fb58403d6e7e3f78a328ba1ccf1123b",
      "text": "I wanted to demonstrate for you just how flexible the Vercel AI SDK is when it comes to model selection.",
      "hash": "0e9aac0c622d2141312f4fcdb7c9f9c8fa4aa9017568d935d197d17b5e027fdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "b416e2125f6fc8f307e2cbe2f47b7c1b1c537a1f5f05917909debcd2b336feb8",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "b61707314b811a6544e56dea3e33048cff775d87a904cc5043cd18ac67b067a4",
      "text": "Here we have an",
      "hash": "ccbb385ee42830ac18d7eb6ad3d75b3233fbe36dbfa93e49ed69ad7866818d3b"
    },
    {
      "id": "ace4a859d046564115628bfb64dd4fa38279c37622cc2765ceba97510feab365",
      "text": "function that takes in a prompt and a model of a type of",
      "hash": "ee09c325f1eaf5c1ba18683eb531d08aec249242200acf1dcf4b4dbb5dd53a4b"
    },
    {
      "id": "1cdeb8b83af3de7ab1ff6cb6a8d28eee1a11114ebe73dc979a7bee0aefeefdb7",
      "text": "We can call this function with any model that the AI SDK provides.",
      "hash": "797b96b738549053a58709b88ee981854d834cb110f39cd8e55631cbb67b4689"
    },
    {
      "id": "484f025f844ea930b5077222847f618991c9d9f7fa64361b0003c35be6c82d55",
      "text": "For instance, we can call it with Anthropic:",
      "hash": "0f3f82b2854db4d2ce43cf136e53500895298ffe981ab47b7d13e30b28cc7cb5"
    },
    {
      "id": "457078e2a955d7910bddfe13e7a200de6ab414607b3da0e0155b339cd36c52c4",
      "text": "Or with OpenAI:",
      "hash": "f220be4c6fa070472e83e7d77b046c33836fc12d656667b6e3079ad9adcca597"
    },
    {
      "id": "1a4722dcd34a23db7f483e1b9dee1a45df7a3c10dfa63bb869b885f2b422570c",
      "text": "This gives you a ton of flexibility with how you want to build your application.",
      "hash": "f9650d72dcd3888f408ccb5dee3ea100e369406f7aae46d95e32759e4387dddf"
    },
    {
      "id": "d88484ecb949576bf3e75187606796c0683aeab278fa60f6ae81f6a3a3be0cf5",
      "text": "The",
      "hash": "b344d80e24a3679999fa964450b34bc24d1578a35509f934c1418b0a20d21a67"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b8120f2cf42a74835fddf37534c897d832c6ec42455e2a88c7a8051cbd689a0",
      "text": "function is totally decoupled from the model that it uses.",
      "hash": "4c7087650dd95a69af1def003718301774c4cd792f4873d9844b032148e4cedd"
    },
    {
      "id": "03711ef77b0296342e09ef5d870213112493a575e90477c86a89e3be37328abd",
      "text": "type exposed by the AI SDK lets you do dependency injection. In other words, you can inject any model into your system.",
      "hash": "f35f202c10d2b929f1ce6d2451ea625ac939cca0a50470c1d1365f5ac3665a17"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f5d16884a04c0a7d11b1ca17d6f11fc65bf6578ede7eeffe8d92cb9dc21cc5c",
      "text": "To me, this is one of the core selling points of the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "cdc0d717afed3b1069e0c8a028b7c2efe1485a09dbc2cff67a798bab3ef4901e"
    },
    {
      "id": "05686b4127e39ee53e77ed24f5af82f8bfe8277edfcf2db5faf78ceb65b76e2d",
      "text": "In our next example, we're going to look at chat history and how you can preserve the history of a chat over time.",
      "hash": "d3e7122088ae54502e143eb2e4e92228195137feede275c88ecd816f417685f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "0e48f476642110ae3c371036c7fb839710808056adda907f561b1008fc26b485",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2464aa2fa4ccc8b2d7002c7ddc455a3ea5c7685299cecc48890bddc7ec0abd9",
